{"ref":"BDB, יַאֲזַנְיָ֫הוּ","hw":"יַאֲזַנְיָ֫הוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יַאֲזַנְיָ֫הוּ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>Yahweh heareth</em><strong>)</strong>—so <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.23\">2 K 25:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.11\">Ez 8:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַאֲזַנְיָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.3\">Je 35:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 11:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.11.1\">Ez 11:1</a>; contr. <span dir=\"rtl\">(וִ)יזַנְיָהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.8\">Je 40:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">(וִ)יזַנְיָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.1\">Je 42:1</a>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a Judæan <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.23\">2 K 25:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.8\">Je 40:8</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  an elder of Isr., son of Shaphan <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.11\">Ez 8:11</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  son of Jeremiah <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.3\">Je 35:3</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  a leading Jedæan, son of Azur <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 11:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.11.1\">Ez 11:1</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  a leading Judæan <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.1\">Je 42:1</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲזַרְיָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.2\">43:2</a>).","next":"BDB, אָזַן²","prev":"BDB, אַזְנוֹת תָּבוֹר"}